WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:05.541
Um, what's this about? Why'd you call
me in during the night shift?

00:00:12.524 --> 00:00:13.391
Impossible!

00:00:13.391 --> 00:00:15.291
It's true. It's gone up again.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:17.896
The probability that The Children...

00:00:17.896 --> 00:00:20.763
will become devils who will destroy this world.

00:00:21.166 --> 00:00:23.726
No... That prediction will become reality?

00:00:30.475 --> 00:00:31.442
Director!

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.578
I told you before, didn't I?
That gun is!

00:00:33.578 --> 00:00:34.374
inamoto...

00:00:35.013 --> 00:00:37.048
What you need right now is the strength...

00:00:37.048 --> 00:00:40.051
and determination to
protect The Children's future.

00:00:40.051 --> 00:00:42.019
You can't keep ignoring this forever.

00:00:42.454 --> 00:00:43.955
Because, otherwise...

00:00:43.955 --> 00:00:45.980
you will be lost in the flow of destiny.

00:00:52.731 --> 00:00:54.824
They're getting less and less effective...

00:00:55.467 --> 00:01:02.566
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:01:03.575 --> 00:01:09.445
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:11.883 --> 00:01:17.685
Meeting you like I did

00:01:18.023 --> 00:01:22.892
Wasn't just so we could live

00:01:24.162 --> 00:01:29.691
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:01:30.101 --> 00:01:34.697
And surely change the future

00:01:35.306 --> 00:01:38.209
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:01:38.209 --> 00:01:41.337
Is released (changing yourself)

00:01:41.479 --> 00:01:47.213
An angel's shining surges through me

00:01:48.653 --> 00:01:51.222
The "wings" that will save the world

00:01:51.222 --> 00:01:54.055
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:01:54.292 --> 00:02:00.458
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:02:00.598 --> 00:02:03.401
The power given to me

00:02:03.401 --> 00:02:06.037
Spurs me into the sky

00:02:06.037 --> 00:02:11.771
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:17.639
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:02:26.391 --> 00:02:28.326
47th sense:
"Life's Troubles Are But a Dream!
Memories of Tomorrow"

00:02:28.326 --> 00:02:31.784
20XX - TOKYO

00:02:35.834 --> 00:02:37.825
ESPER REVOLT IN NEW YORK!
MANY DEAD OR WOUNDED

00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:47.868
It hasn't changed. As clean and neat as always.

00:02:51.683 --> 00:02:52.817
I'm home.

00:02:52.817 --> 00:02:54.819
We figured you'd come, Kaoru.

00:02:54.819 --> 00:02:56.980
We didn't want to meet like this, though.

00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:01.723
It's been a while, Aoi, Shiho.

00:03:02.026 --> 00:03:03.728
Don't give us that!

00:03:03.728 --> 00:03:05.864
Mr. Minamoto went to
New York to look for you!

00:03:05.864 --> 00:03:06.592
I know.

00:03:07.132 --> 00:03:09.367
I came to see you today.

00:03:09.367 --> 00:03:12.029
I figured you'd both be watching this place.

00:03:12.737 --> 00:03:14.898
You really thought we'd follow you?

00:03:15.473 --> 00:03:19.637
You seriously think we'd join
PANDRA and fight the Normals?

00:03:26.885 --> 00:03:29.821
But how?! It had anti-ESP defenses!

00:03:29.821 --> 00:03:32.624
There's debris everywhere! I can't teleport!

00:03:32.624 --> 00:03:34.387
You both still came.

00:03:34.926 --> 00:03:37.759
After all, we've been best
friends since we were kids.

00:03:38.096 --> 00:03:39.563
Best friends, huh?!

00:03:41.032 --> 00:03:46.766
Do you know what I've seen?
What the Normals do to espers in secret?

00:03:47.605 --> 00:03:50.665
Don't be taken in! She's not the Kaoru we knew!

00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:53.776
The fact she hasn't tried one creepy
old guy gag yet is proof of that!

00:03:54.212 --> 00:03:57.010
I haven't changed! I just put that stuff aside!

00:04:05.356 --> 00:04:06.983
Even I...

00:04:07.792 --> 00:04:11.023
I'd have done anything to let
us go on living like we were...

00:04:12.597 --> 00:04:13.932
20XX - PRESENT DAY

00:04:13.932 --> 00:04:17.101
20XX - PRESENT DAY
Man, is there anything cuter
than brand-new first graders?

00:04:17.101 --> 00:04:18.036
Man, is there anything cuter
than brand-new first graders?

00:04:18.036 --> 00:04:20.305
You'd never think that in only 4 or 5 years,

00:04:20.305 --> 00:04:23.007
some of them will be grownup
girls with big boobs!

00:04:23.007 --> 00:04:24.576
Why do you have to think like a creepy old guy?

00:04:24.576 --> 00:04:25.543
Well, that's been her thing since she was little.

00:04:25.543 --> 00:04:28.246
Entrance Ceremony
Well, that's been her thing since she was little.

00:04:28.246 --> 00:04:30.682
Entrance Ceremony
Still, we're fifth-graders now.

00:04:30.682 --> 00:04:31.516
Entrance Ceremony
Except nothing's changed a bit!

00:04:31.516 --> 00:04:33.084
Except nothing's changed a bit!

00:04:33.084 --> 00:04:35.386
Really! They haven't grown a bit!

00:04:35.386 --> 00:04:36.688
So sad!

00:04:36.688 --> 00:04:39.757
Could you put that aside and grow up already?!

00:04:39.757 --> 00:04:42.783
She's right, Kaoru. It's bad for your education.

00:04:43.127 --> 00:04:46.097
Oh, Mr. Minamoto. Is the night shift over?

00:04:46.097 --> 00:04:48.266
What's that? Cake?

00:04:48.266 --> 00:04:50.097
To celebrate our going up a grade, right?

00:04:51.336 --> 00:04:52.860
Um, no. Actually, this is...

00:04:55.707 --> 00:04:57.108
Kinda plain, isn't it?

00:04:57.108 --> 00:04:59.702
It's a normal snack. Any complaints?

00:05:00.278 --> 00:05:03.047
You don't have a celebration
for just advancing one grade.

00:05:03.047 --> 00:05:05.072
Even if you did, it wouldn't change anything...

00:05:05.316 --> 00:05:07.944
There's no love in this! Jerk! Jerk! Jerk!

00:05:08.019 --> 00:05:10.488
If you're going to complain about
it that much, I'll take it back.

00:05:10.488 --> 00:05:11.614
Screw that!

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:14.659
But you'll have a real celebration
for us tomorrow, right?

00:05:14.659 --> 00:05:17.428
You won't give up, will you? I said I wouldn't.

00:05:17.428 --> 00:05:19.597
Now, I've been working all night,
so I'm going to bed.

00:05:19.597 --> 00:05:22.066
Hey, wait! What about tomorrow?

00:05:22.066 --> 00:05:24.091
What's with Minamoto?!

00:05:35.046 --> 00:05:38.106
Should I really leave things as they are?

00:05:40.018 --> 00:05:43.044
Still, the director may have a point.

00:05:44.255 --> 00:05:47.224
Even they won't stay children forever.

00:05:48.326 --> 00:05:49.816
What will be the trigger?

00:05:50.862 --> 00:05:52.625
No matter what happens, I!

00:05:53.231 --> 00:05:55.529
I have to protect them!

00:06:00.271 --> 00:06:01.465
What the?!

00:06:04.909 --> 00:06:06.778
Hello, you three.

00:06:06.778 --> 00:06:08.279
Congratulations on moving up a grade.

00:06:08.279 --> 00:06:10.110
You're that much closer to adulthood now.

00:06:11.049 --> 00:06:12.617
Major Hyobu?

00:06:12.617 --> 00:06:14.485
That's kind of a new look.

00:06:14.485 --> 00:06:15.787
Kind of?

00:06:15.787 --> 00:06:17.755
Oh, this?

00:06:17.755 --> 00:06:21.316
That's funny, I wore this on
the advice of my comrades.

00:06:21.726 --> 00:06:24.329
Huh? I hate it when people
try to dress too young!

00:06:24.329 --> 00:06:26.931
Like a school uniform is dressing your age?!

00:06:26.931 --> 00:06:28.330
Shut up and wear this!

00:06:28.866 --> 00:06:32.637
And since those two are
acting as lookouts for me,

00:06:32.637 --> 00:06:35.868
today I'm wearing every sort of limiter there is.

00:06:36.307 --> 00:06:39.477
For today, I'm no different from any Normal.

00:06:39.477 --> 00:06:42.447
However, I brought a
bodyguard along, just in case.

00:06:42.447 --> 00:06:44.482
And by that, you mean this guy here?

00:06:44.482 --> 00:06:46.050
Oh, Momotaro.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:49.281
Yeah, you brought a real
dependable tough guy with you.

00:06:49.987 --> 00:06:54.058
I guess. However, I am the
defender of lovely young girls!

00:06:54.058 --> 00:06:56.627
I'll always protect you from
this lolicon, no matter what!

00:06:56.627 --> 00:06:58.696
How wonderful. What can possibly go wrong?

00:06:58.696 --> 00:06:59.630
Hey!

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:01.621
I'll glad you came along.

00:07:02.066 --> 00:07:04.534
Okay? Nothing to worry about, right?

00:07:05.803 --> 00:07:09.500
I just had to celebrate your growth with you!

00:07:10.208 --> 00:07:11.402
You'll go out with me, won't you?

00:07:13.411 --> 00:07:16.447
Well, I suppose we could for a little while,
just to see what you're up to.

00:07:16.447 --> 00:07:18.249
Where are you taking us?

00:07:18.249 --> 00:07:19.614
To someplace great.

00:07:23.321 --> 00:07:24.481
Come on, get in!

00:07:26.758 --> 00:07:29.852
Kaoru... Aoi... Shiho...

00:07:31.929 --> 00:07:33.498
The "great place"...

00:07:33.498 --> 00:07:36.434
...is here? It's just an amusement park.

00:07:36.434 --> 00:07:39.303
You don't like it? After I rented it for us?

00:07:39.303 --> 00:07:42.340
No, it's just... It's so normal for you.

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:45.376
Yes. This is a place where
normal people come to play.

00:07:45.376 --> 00:07:47.207
Trouble is...

00:07:47.745 --> 00:07:50.043
We're not normal.

00:07:51.249 --> 00:07:54.252
Facilities have been making
a lot of noise about ESP lately.

00:07:54.252 --> 00:07:57.155
You girls can't play in a place like this, can you?

00:07:57.155 --> 00:07:58.122
Am I wrong?

00:07:58.122 --> 00:07:59.089
Well...

00:07:59.657 --> 00:08:02.527
Mommy, I want to go with Sis!

00:08:02.527 --> 00:08:05.062
Why do I have to stay home with you?

00:08:05.062 --> 00:08:06.697
Mom... Sis...

00:08:06.697 --> 00:08:09.400
Don't let it bother you. It's not your fault.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:10.334
Father.

00:08:10.334 --> 00:08:12.069
The people who play there...

00:08:12.069 --> 00:08:15.973
will reach their hands out of
the toilets and pull you in!

00:08:15.973 --> 00:08:18.100
And then they'll take all your money!

00:08:18.409 --> 00:08:19.034
Dad.

00:08:20.311 --> 00:08:22.040
So, where shall we begin our fun?

00:08:23.181 --> 00:08:26.446
To be honest, I've never ridden
any of these before, either.

00:08:27.385 --> 00:08:28.653
I want that one!

00:08:28.653 --> 00:08:30.087
I'll take the game center!

00:08:30.087 --> 00:08:32.578
I... Hey! Wait for me!

00:08:33.391 --> 00:08:34.483
No rush! No rush!

00:08:37.361 --> 00:08:37.995
That's!

00:08:37.995 --> 00:08:39.630
You still have that?

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:40.565
Well...

00:08:40.565 --> 00:08:41.399
Right?

00:08:41.399 --> 00:08:42.500
Right!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.731
After what we went through to get it,
there's no way we'd just give it back!

00:08:46.037 --> 00:08:48.028
Anyway, don't be such killjoys.

00:08:48.439 --> 00:08:50.703
The Children, released!

00:08:51.275 --> 00:08:53.711
Round and round, goes the merry-go-round.

00:08:53.711 --> 00:08:55.680
I don't care what happens after this!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.882
Okay! Today, we cut loose!

00:08:57.882 --> 00:09:00.518
Today, BABEL and PANDRA shake
hands at the amusement park!

00:09:00.518 --> 00:09:02.349
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:09:08.159 --> 00:09:10.995
But, this isn't any different
from what she normally does.

00:09:10.995 --> 00:09:12.155
Hey, how about that?

00:09:13.164 --> 00:09:14.332
I don't want to!

00:09:14.332 --> 00:09:15.500
It'll be fine!

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.834
You'll love it!

00:09:16.834 --> 00:09:18.069
No! No!

00:09:18.069 --> 00:09:20.697
HAUNTED HOUSE

00:09:22.607 --> 00:09:25.132
Teleport Shadow Clones!

00:09:28.479 --> 00:09:30.248
This is hurting my eyes.

00:09:30.248 --> 00:09:32.216
She's hitting between 8 to 10 frames a second.

00:09:32.283 --> 00:09:33.818
YOU ROCK!
You rock!

00:09:33.818 --> 00:09:34.842
YOU ROCK!
All right!

00:09:36.387 --> 00:09:40.414
Hey, shouldn't we be heading home?
Mr. Minamoto might be worried.

00:09:41.492 --> 00:09:43.127
He's probably still asleep.

00:09:43.127 --> 00:09:46.197
You're playing it cool, I see.
Aren't you having fun?

00:09:46.197 --> 00:09:49.325
The amusement park is fun,
but not with you.

00:09:49.967 --> 00:09:53.903
We'd rather be here with
Mr. Minamoto than with you.

00:09:55.506 --> 00:09:59.442
You shouldn't mention other
guys while on a date, Empress.

00:09:59.877 --> 00:10:01.612
Why are you calling me that?!

00:10:01.612 --> 00:10:03.514
Kyosuke, I'm hungry!

00:10:03.514 --> 00:10:04.482
Actually...

00:10:04.482 --> 00:10:05.383
So am I.

00:10:05.383 --> 00:10:08.986
I see. There's no staff working here now, so...

00:10:08.986 --> 00:10:10.688
Shall we get something to eat?

00:10:10.688 --> 00:10:12.957
I'll take you wherever you want.

00:10:12.957 --> 00:10:14.258
Really?

00:10:14.258 --> 00:10:16.590
Is that her Achilles Heel?

00:10:18.729 --> 00:10:22.900
But what about the meal
Mr. Minamoto made in the fridge?

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:25.562
Okay, how about this?

00:10:28.739 --> 00:10:32.607
Sounds like fun.
You really are the queen, Kaoru!

00:10:33.811 --> 00:10:36.177
Seriously? I was kidding.

00:10:39.684 --> 00:10:41.618
W-We're home.

00:10:43.521 --> 00:10:45.923
Okay, wait here while we get it ready.

00:10:45.923 --> 00:10:46.548
Thank you.

00:10:47.291 --> 00:10:50.749
We don't want to wake the man
of the house. Do it quietly.

00:10:50.828 --> 00:10:53.319
Ooh! I haven't been here in a while!

00:10:53.731 --> 00:10:55.221
And then you go and say that!

00:10:55.366 --> 00:10:56.934
Should we heat it up?

00:10:56.934 --> 00:10:59.232
What's this? Oh, it's stew.

00:11:00.638 --> 00:11:01.339
Can we use these for the plates?

00:11:01.339 --> 00:11:03.330
Shut up...
Can we use these for the plates?

00:11:05.943 --> 00:11:08.639
Just don't feed me squid ink
or anything like that, please.

00:11:10.715 --> 00:11:13.843
Remember, kids, the third month
of the lunar calendar is Yayoi!

00:11:16.887 --> 00:11:18.912
So, this is what you usually eat?

00:11:23.661 --> 00:11:26.797
A bit working-class,
but it has an honest flavor to it.

00:11:26.797 --> 00:11:30.201
I think Mr. Minamoto's a great cook.

00:11:30.201 --> 00:11:31.668
If you don't like it, you're free to leave.

00:11:32.603 --> 00:11:36.300
Please, don't take it as an insult.
I meant to say it tasted homey.

00:11:36.807 --> 00:11:39.537
Don't you think bringing him
home was overdoing it?

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:43.147
Well, I didn't hear either of
you objecting very hard!

00:11:43.147 --> 00:11:45.016
I guess we just went along without thinking...

00:11:45.016 --> 00:11:45.880
I can hear you.

00:11:46.651 --> 00:11:48.846
We lived in very similar circumstances.

00:11:49.787 --> 00:11:51.220
Didn't Fujiko tell you?

00:11:51.889 --> 00:11:55.950
I was a special esper, too,
when I was around your age.

00:11:56.827 --> 00:11:59.363
The Imperial Army's Special ESP Unit.

00:11:59.363 --> 00:12:01.499
It was what would eventually become BABEL.

00:12:01.499 --> 00:12:02.500
That was...

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:03.933
Old man Igo's unit?

00:12:04.235 --> 00:12:06.270
You were one of his comrades, Kyosuke?

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:09.040
Our missions were different
from what you do now, though.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:12.976
Our powers were developed for the
benefit of society and our nation.

00:12:13.878 --> 00:12:15.675
Why's he telling them about this now?

00:12:16.013 --> 00:12:19.278
Eventually, war broke out.
And we became weapons.

00:12:20.217 --> 00:12:23.487
But even then, I thought
I was doing the right thing.

00:12:23.487 --> 00:12:25.421
At the very least, I had my comrades.

00:12:26.223 --> 00:12:28.214
Because I believed in them.

00:12:30.828 --> 00:12:32.997
There! Did you see that, Fujiko?!

00:12:32.997 --> 00:12:34.897
That puts my kill score on top!

00:12:36.701 --> 00:12:37.668
Fujiko!

00:12:42.573 --> 00:12:44.408
Sorry, I got hit.

00:12:44.408 --> 00:12:45.509
Get back to the carrier!

00:12:45.509 --> 00:12:49.741
Can't. My psychic power's spent,
so I can't teleport.

00:12:50.014 --> 00:12:53.284
Then I'll take you! Can you stop the bleeding?

00:12:53.284 --> 00:12:53.909
Yeah.

00:12:54.618 --> 00:13:00.579
But we didn't have many espers then,
and even our powers had their limit...

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:07.092
Against the flow of world events,
we couldn't change a single thing.

00:13:07.565 --> 00:13:12.403
This war is lost to us. The only
path left is unconditional surrender.

00:13:12.403 --> 00:13:13.267
No!

00:13:13.504 --> 00:13:15.773
We don't have the strength to fight on anymore.

00:13:15.773 --> 00:13:18.676
Aside from you, every member
of the ESP Unit is wounded.

00:13:18.676 --> 00:13:20.007
Then I'll fight alone!

00:13:20.277 --> 00:13:21.979
I can at least bomb the enemy homeland!

00:13:21.979 --> 00:13:25.483
Enough. Our destiny has been decided.

00:13:25.483 --> 00:13:26.684
Decided?

00:13:26.684 --> 00:13:30.415
Defeat, rebuilding...
And the destruction to come!

00:13:30.788 --> 00:13:31.756
What's?

00:13:31.756 --> 00:13:33.758
The brain of a dead dolphin.

00:13:33.758 --> 00:13:35.817
We successfully retrieved it from Okinawa.

00:13:36.427 --> 00:13:41.421
We learned from our analysis that 1-009
concealed a prediction from us.

00:13:42.133 --> 00:13:44.835
After the war, espers will continue to increase.

00:13:44.835 --> 00:13:49.033
You will become their leader
and destroy the world!

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:52.143
Captain, what are you talking about?!

00:13:52.143 --> 00:13:55.179
There's no need for the
occupation forces to know...

00:13:55.179 --> 00:13:57.272
that we created a monster like you.

00:13:57.882 --> 00:14:00.077
You're joking, right?

00:14:07.291 --> 00:14:09.759
The war with our fellow humans is over.

00:14:10.394 --> 00:14:13.852
Now to finish our next enemy,
the esper, while we have the chance!

00:14:14.265 --> 00:14:16.699
Next enemy? Monster?

00:14:17.434 --> 00:14:18.799
Is that all we were?

00:14:19.436 --> 00:14:20.664
In the end, we're just...

00:14:28.145 --> 00:14:29.313
Congratulations.

00:14:29.313 --> 00:14:32.516
You've earned yourself a
special two-rank promotion.

00:14:32.516 --> 00:14:35.644
Now to give the rest of your comrades
an honorable death in combat.

00:14:37.688 --> 00:14:38.279
Impossible!

00:14:44.228 --> 00:14:47.197
You call me the monster?

00:14:47.765 --> 00:14:51.929
After that, multiple powers awakened within me.

00:14:52.069 --> 00:14:52.558
Hm?

00:14:53.037 --> 00:14:55.439
You're not eating.
I thought you were hungry.

00:14:55.439 --> 00:14:57.964
What kind of person could eat
while listening to that story?!

00:15:00.311 --> 00:15:02.142
It's not the same.

00:15:02.646 --> 00:15:06.183
If that man had been like Minamoto,
even you would have!

00:15:06.183 --> 00:15:07.582
You think so?

00:15:08.819 --> 00:15:10.821
He's a Normal.

00:15:10.821 --> 00:15:13.915
When push comes to shove,
which side do you think he'll choose?

00:15:16.794 --> 00:15:17.628
Mm!

00:15:17.628 --> 00:15:18.754
Mr. Minamoto!

00:15:21.332 --> 00:15:22.026
Girls...

00:15:23.767 --> 00:15:27.134
Have you seen my glasses?
I can't see a thing.

00:15:32.877 --> 00:15:34.139
I thought I left them around here...

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:37.948
What's the big idea?!

00:15:37.948 --> 00:15:39.850
S-Sorry! I was trying to hand them to you!

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:40.441
Hi!

00:15:41.018 --> 00:15:42.781
Pardon the intrusion!

00:15:48.559 --> 00:15:50.151
Oh, come on, Goddess!

00:15:51.962 --> 00:15:54.931
Major... You look like a two-bit
Casanova out there.

00:15:55.332 --> 00:15:57.401
Huh? Is someone here?

00:15:57.401 --> 00:16:00.137
Never mind that! I hear Shiho in the bathroom!

00:16:00.137 --> 00:16:02.435
Mr. Minamoto, save me!

00:16:02.907 --> 00:16:03.635
Shiho!

00:16:05.009 --> 00:16:05.876
Shiho!

00:16:05.876 --> 00:16:06.844
Now's your chance!

00:16:06.844 --> 00:16:07.640
Roger!

00:16:08.512 --> 00:16:11.379
Darn it, Aoi! You're SO gonna pay for this!

00:16:13.684 --> 00:16:15.953
I still haven't thanked him for the meal.

00:16:15.953 --> 00:16:17.284
You don't have to!

00:16:18.155 --> 00:16:20.424
My compliments to the chef.
Here's a tip for him!

00:16:20.424 --> 00:16:21.288
No need!

00:16:21.825 --> 00:16:23.087
Actually...

00:16:25.996 --> 00:16:29.867
As you can see, I can release all my limiters.

00:16:29.867 --> 00:16:33.735
I was planning to use my
Hypno in case he noticed me.

00:16:34.939 --> 00:16:35.997
If Minamoto...

00:16:36.573 --> 00:16:39.201
If you do anything to Minamoto,
I absolutely will never forgive you!

00:16:41.078 --> 00:16:43.380
That's why I'm waiting patiently for my time.

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:45.349
But I can still tease him, can't I?

00:16:45.349 --> 00:16:46.111
No!

00:16:47.318 --> 00:16:51.055
Minamoto's a good man!
He's not like the other Normals!

00:16:51.055 --> 00:16:51.487
Ever since...

00:16:52.222 --> 00:16:55.419
Ever since Minamoto came,
we've all changed! Completely!

00:16:56.560 --> 00:17:00.052
I love you and your abilities.

00:17:00.764 --> 00:17:04.495
The man who shot me used to say similar things.

00:17:05.135 --> 00:17:06.904
They're all the same.

00:17:06.904 --> 00:17:07.738
That's a lie!

00:17:07.738 --> 00:17:09.740
No, it's not. I'm trying
to make you all see that...

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:13.277
Minamoto's different!
He'd never do something like that!

00:17:13.277 --> 00:17:13.800
Kaoru?

00:17:15.346 --> 00:17:16.677
Stubborn fool.

00:17:17.214 --> 00:17:19.614
It seems words won't be
enough to make you understand.

00:17:20.584 --> 00:17:21.285
Hey, what are you saying?!

00:17:21.285 --> 00:17:22.386
Just stand back.
Hey, what are you saying?!

00:17:22.386 --> 00:17:22.909
Just stand back.

00:17:25.823 --> 00:17:27.024
Kyosuke...

00:17:27.024 --> 00:17:28.325
Sure you want to let me go?

00:17:28.325 --> 00:17:33.524
If you leave me at large,
the people you love may be in danger.

00:17:34.064 --> 00:17:36.667
Why, you! PSYCHIC AXE KICK!

00:17:36.667 --> 00:17:37.725
Too easy.

00:17:38.702 --> 00:17:40.567
PSYCHIC IRON HAMMER!

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:46.103
Dammit! PSYCHIC AFTERIMAGE
HUNDRED CRACK FIST!

00:17:46.343 --> 00:17:49.278
Is that it? All that growth,
and this is the extent of your power?

00:17:51.015 --> 00:17:53.245
PSYCHIC AEGIS SHIELD!

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:08.766
You'll never be able to protect
your beloved Minamoto...

00:18:08.766 --> 00:18:10.401
if that's the best you can do.

00:18:10.401 --> 00:18:11.026
Kyosuke!

00:18:11.668 --> 00:18:13.003
Not just him.

00:18:13.003 --> 00:18:16.131
Not Aoi or Shiho or any of the
people you cherish now.

00:18:17.341 --> 00:18:19.275
At the rate you're going, one day...

00:18:27.117 --> 00:18:30.387
PSYCHIC SCISSORS WAVE!

00:18:30.387 --> 00:18:31.081
What?!

00:18:44.701 --> 00:18:46.770
Kaoru, what was that?

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.635
I squeezed my power as thin as it could go.

00:18:49.039 --> 00:18:51.030
Just the way you taught me, Kyosuke.

00:18:54.244 --> 00:18:57.372
I don't hate you, but!

00:19:00.084 --> 00:19:00.607
Major!

00:19:07.791 --> 00:19:11.192
But if you ever do anything to Minamoto!

00:19:19.303 --> 00:19:21.863
Incredible. You're developing
beyond what I predicted.

00:19:30.147 --> 00:19:32.516
Kyosuke, you intentionally
made her cry, didn't you?!

00:19:32.516 --> 00:19:34.416
I didn't really mean to, but...

00:19:34.952 --> 00:19:38.122
All right. I'll withdraw for now.

00:19:38.122 --> 00:19:38.588
However...

00:19:40.624 --> 00:19:42.353
Please don't forget, Kaoru.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:46.193
I'm not the one who's really hurting you. He is.

00:19:46.697 --> 00:19:48.722
We'll play again. See you.

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:55.236
Kyosuke, you jerk!

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:58.105
Tomorrow is...

00:19:58.742 --> 00:20:01.745
It'll be one year since I became
your supervisor, won't it?

00:20:01.745 --> 00:20:03.713
Oh, so you did remember.

00:20:05.082 --> 00:20:06.216
I'm back!

00:20:06.216 --> 00:20:08.252
Kaoru? Where were you at this hour?

00:20:08.252 --> 00:20:09.987
That's why we have to celebrate!

00:20:09.987 --> 00:20:12.156
My spare glasses? Where did you?

00:20:12.156 --> 00:20:14.283
So, didn't you get us anything?
Like a present?

00:20:15.592 --> 00:20:19.551
It's nothing to get too excited over,
but I thought we'd mark the occasion.

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:24.328
Here.

00:20:26.637 --> 00:20:27.804
A music box?

00:20:27.804 --> 00:20:29.506
It plays Träumerei.

00:20:29.506 --> 00:20:31.475
And it has a picture frame, too!

00:20:31.475 --> 00:20:34.273
Yeah. Tomorrow,
let's take a picture of us all.

00:20:35.445 --> 00:20:37.345
Not tomorrow! Now!

00:20:38.182 --> 00:20:39.216
Do it now!

00:20:39.216 --> 00:20:40.284
Kaoru?

00:20:40.284 --> 00:20:42.186
But I'm soaking wet!

00:20:42.186 --> 00:20:43.244
Who cares?!

00:20:44.021 --> 00:20:45.122
Minamoto!

00:20:45.122 --> 00:20:46.384
Me, too!

00:20:47.791 --> 00:20:50.589
Because no one can know...

00:20:56.133 --> 00:20:58.601
what tomorrow might bring.

00:21:02.272 --> 00:21:04.474
All we'll do is hear you out.

00:21:04.474 --> 00:21:07.136
But don't expect anything more.

00:21:07.211 --> 00:21:07.905
I understand.

00:21:09.213 --> 00:21:09.975
Thank you.

00:21:12.482 --> 00:21:17.215
In springtime at dawn, one sleeps
a sleep that knows no dawn...

00:21:18.088 --> 00:21:19.077
Minamoto!

00:21:19.356 --> 00:21:23.258
I need to visit a few agencies.
I'll be back in the afternoon.

00:21:23.694 --> 00:21:25.924
Roger! Take care!

00:21:31.168 --> 00:21:31.930
Hi.

00:21:32.536 --> 00:21:34.470
Could you give this to
The Children for me?

00:21:34.938 --> 00:21:38.237
Seeing how you don't plan
to celebrate their growth.

00:21:42.379 --> 00:21:44.948
What's wrong? Aren't you going to shoot me?

00:21:44.948 --> 00:21:47.041
With that crude thing you carry hidden on you?

00:21:48.118 --> 00:21:50.052
Get it through your head, kid.

00:21:50.654 --> 00:21:54.021
Appreciate how much happiness
you have right now.

00:21:56.426 --> 00:21:57.893
Treasure it.

00:21:58.528 --> 00:22:02.020
Because, second by second,
the future's getting nearer, Minamoto.

00:22:03.734 --> 00:22:05.258
What are you?

00:22:20.817 --> 00:22:24.421
I turn to the front, embracing the dream

00:22:24.421 --> 00:22:28.392
Making up my mind, looking up to the sky

00:22:28.392 --> 00:22:34.464
I'll fly beyond the future with my wings

00:22:34.464 --> 00:22:38.335
You alone are my heart's desire!

00:22:38.335 --> 00:22:42.306
I declared that I love you absolutely

00:22:42.306 --> 00:22:48.211
As the shining seasons pass

00:22:48.945 --> 00:22:52.983
Your face is still as troubled as in

00:22:52.983 --> 00:22:56.851
The photos I took to remember those days

00:22:57.487 --> 00:23:03.687
As I shed warm, gentle tears

00:23:04.895 --> 00:23:08.465
Let's try to meet here tomorrow, too

00:23:08.465 --> 00:23:12.035
Without making promises, let's go

00:23:12.035 --> 00:23:16.006
As casually as always

00:23:16.006 --> 00:23:21.239
Waving my little hand with a smile

00:23:22.245 --> 00:23:27.080
"Bye bye, till we meet again"

00:23:40.731 --> 00:23:40.931
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:40.931 --> 00:23:41.898
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.898 --> 00:23:42.566
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.566 --> 00:23:44.201
Just me?! No way!

00:23:44.201 --> 00:23:47.295
No using your powers for the next few days,
until your brain damage clears up.

00:23:47.371 --> 00:23:48.472
Just take it easy.

00:23:48.472 --> 00:23:49.734
Yeah. You don't have to come.

00:23:50.107 --> 00:23:53.910
Sucks for you, huh, Queen?
It's not like I want to ask for your help,

00:23:53.910 --> 00:23:55.912
but they said we need
you to fight Black Phantom.

00:23:55.912 --> 00:23:56.847
You need me?

00:23:56.847 --> 00:23:58.448
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:58.448 --> 00:24:01.184
Episode 48: "A Disturbance in the Force!
The Phantom Menace!"

00:24:01.184 --> 00:24:02.652
No good! I don't have the power!

00:24:02.652 --> 00:24:04.955
I need Aoi and Shiho, but!

00:24:04.955 --> 00:24:06.523
Do it, Kaoru!

00:24:06.523 --> 00:24:06.690
A Disturbance in the Force!
The Phantom Menace
Do it, Kaoru!

00:24:06.690 --> 00:24:08.925
A Disturbance in the Force!
The Phantom Menace
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.925 --> 00:24:09.823
A Disturbance in the Force!
The Phantom Menace
